                                "sense_id": "9f0003e4-fdd4-372a-b2c0-34b9be40aea9",
                                "text": "Facebook does not allow for pre-moderation of comments on pages and comments cannot be turned off, however NSW supreme court justice Stephen Rothman had argued that the media companies could have used a word filter using extremely common words to pre-filter the majority of comments to only be visible to the page owner and that user and their friends."
